-- ============================================================================
-- Phase D: Apply Price List Library NET COSTS (~432 rows) from
-- 'Price List Libraries.xlsx' sheet 3 (Price List Library).
-- IMPORTANT: seeds material_rate/labor_rate with NET COST (pre-margin), matching
-- pullFromElementLibrary()'s semantics in tender-cost-service.ts, which applies
-- the tender's own default_labor_margin_pct/default_material_margin_pct on top
-- at pull time. Do NOT seed the already-margined Rate ($) columns here.
-- Only rows present in this sheet get in_price_list = true; all other
-- Description Library rows keep material_rate/labor_rate = NULL and
-- in_price_list = false (they are priceable but not yet priced).
-- ============================================================================
